  <title type="string">Against what the gallery cleaner threw away</title>
  <description type="string">Hiroshi Jovanović talks about a portrait of the wind, from behind. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as &quot;…&quot;.</description>
